    "title": "Stay and Explore Fayetteville's Hispanic-Owned Businesses - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jennifer Radonich ,\n11 hours ago Celebrate and support Hispanic-owned businesses year-round in greater Fayetteville. Here is a sampling of diverse businesses to pick from. Step into Gallery 13, located at 240 Hay St., and get ready to have your mind blown! Artist and owner Carlos Tolentino’s talent is on full display. Whether it’s tattoo, bleach, acrylic, epoxy, or whatever medium he uses, the results are all the same … exceptional! His talent is otherworldly and a must-experience if you’re downtown. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
